  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.0.0-preview.3\n\t\t- MentorDashboard reworked into an Azure-style operator view: per-model breakdown (cheap / strong / embedding) with a model selector, temporal inline-SVG charts (tokens / requests / latency; no JS, CSP-safe, theme-aware) and a per-model cost table. New per-model contracts (MentorModelUsage / MentorUsagePoint / MentorModelKind) on MentorMetricsSnapshot. Fully localized via MentorLocalizer.\n\t\t- Fix (important): added a project _Imports.razor with \"@using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Web\". Without it, the event-handler directives (@onclick / @onchange / @bind) in the shipped components did not resolve — they compiled to literal HTML attributes with no build warning and never fired (the dashboard selector, WelcomePanel chips, ConfirmationBanner HITL buttons and MCP/A2A badges were all affected).\n\t\t- Refreshed the package icon (new MentorAgent \"MA\" logo).",
